<title>UK: Greenhills Plc appoints receivers.</title>
<headline>Greenhills Plc appoints receivers.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>UK themed restaurant operator Greenhills Plc said on Thursday it had appointed receivers on December 4.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement that it intended to make an application to the court to appoint an administrator.</p>
<p>The London Stock Exchange said it had insisted that the company made an announcement on its status.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
